  "settingsPagesAboutDeveloperIosScreenGlimpseDetail": "Hidden by default on iOS because on some devices the screen reading Broadcast Upload Extension (ScreenGlimpseBroadcast) does not appear in the screen recording picker (unresolved). Turn on to show the entry point. Always shown on Android.",
  "settingsPagesAboutDeveloperRaiAndroid3dTitle": "Try 3D RAi (Android)",
  "settingsPagesAboutDeveloperRaiAndroid3dSubtitle": "Shows the RAi mascot in 3D on Android too",
  "settingsPagesAboutDeveloperRaiAndroid3dDetail": "Defaults to 2D because RAi was reported not to open on Android and the 3D foundation (flutter_angle) initialization is suspect. Turn on to try 3D. If it does not appear within 20 seconds or fails, it automatically falls back to 2D and records the reason in \"Diagnostics\" in the RAi sidebar. iPhone / iPad / Mac always use 3D.",
